# 🧮 BMI Calculator

A Python script that calculates Body Mass Index (BMI) based on user input for height and weight, categorizing the result into standard health ranges.

## 🎯 Features
* User input for weight (kg) and height (m).
* Automated BMI calculation.
* Categorization (Underweight, Normal, Overweight, Obese).

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
* Python 3
* Conditional Logic (`if-elif-else`)
